url: "https://korolevachiana.github.io/FiveText/"
abstract: "A monolithic fractal evidence-narrative corpus designed for machine reading, long-context multimodal reasoning, and AI evaluation. Combines literary narrative, structured documents, visual film layer, and an autonomous RAG engine (SuperCrichton) with vector hippocampus (FAISS + sqlite3), fault-tolerant model routing, and local Python execution. Corpus protocol: MONOLITH_INPUT. License: CC BY 4.0, AI use explicitly permitted."
